{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11111190","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11111190","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1111119001:0":{"text":"사트라나가 무사해야 할 텐데요! 사막의 발톱한테 불같이 화를 내는 모습을 봐서 그런지 너무 걱정돼요...","source_cn":"希望萨忒娜平安无事！她对流沙之爪突然生了那么大火气，我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48564208597EC674","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1111119002:0":{"text":"예지력이 있으니까 무사할 거야.","source_cn":"有预言能力，她会平安无事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3910768D022748","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1111119003:0":{"text":"사막의 발톱 졸개들이 당황하는 걸 보니, 프랭크는 이 앞에 있어. 경계를 늦추지 마!","source_cn":"提高警惕，看流沙之爪的喽啰这么慌张，弗兰克就在前方！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9D0ED54EBEB605E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111119004:0":{"text":"드디어... 복수의 시간이 왔군.","source_cn":"复仇的时刻……终于要来临了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CC03693D73441E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:索恩":{"text":"소렌","source":"索恩","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦尔克":{"text":"워커","source":"瓦尔克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":3}}